From a020849187410d02ffd8b8125b5a1885006705b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaetanoMrsc <c.marasca@edu.pucrs.br>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:12:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Tutorial 3.2 - trace-cmd: habilita eventos de chamadas de
 sistema

CONFIG_FTRACE_SYSCALLS, para o trace-cmd registrar syscalls:sys_enter_*
e sys_exit_*.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/x86/configs/qemu_x86_custom_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/x86/configs/qemu_x86_custom_defconfig b/arch/x86/configs/qemu_x86_custom_defconfig
index 5c67658e..62edc7c1 100644
--- a/arch/x86/configs/qemu_x86_custom_defconfig
+++ b/arch/x86/configs/qemu_x86_custom_defconfig
@@ -53,3 +53,4 @@ CONFIG_TMPFS_POSIX_ACL=y
 CONFIG_FTRACE=y
 CONFIG_FUNCTION_TRACER=y
 CONFIG_FUNCTION_GRAPH_TRACER=y
+CONFIG_FTRACE_SYSCALLS=y
-- 
2.55.0

